  "body": "Deadline sale: Closes on Thursday 12 November 2026 at 3:00PM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nSchool mornings just got effortless — step across the road to Westlake Boys High, with Westlake Girls High and Takapuna Normal Intermediate moments away. But what truly sets this home apart is its thoughtful reverse-level design — where living, light, and views take centre stage. \r\n\r\nThoughtfully Curated Layout\r\nThree bedrooms sit comfortably on the ground floor — ideal for children, guests, or a quiet home office. This peaceful lower level gives everyone their own space, while the entire upper floor is dedicated to the heart of your home.\r\n\r\n Upstairs — Where the Magic Happens\r\nAscend to the open-plan living level and the space opens right up — soaring ceilings, abundant natural light, and a sense of volume that simply takes your breath away. Expansive glass doors invite you out onto the spacious upper deck — where stunning sea views stretch out before you. It’s your private sanctuary above the rooftops — sunlit, airy, and endlessly scenic. The luxurious master suite completes this upper level — your quiet retreat with those same incredible ocean vistas just outside your door.\r\n\r\n Craftsmanship & Quality\r\n•Freehold standalone home — no body corporate fees\r\n\r\n•  Double-glazed + fully insulated — warm, quiet, efficient\r\n• Heat pumps throughout — year-round comfort\r\n• Premium Bosch appliances — quality you can rely on\r\n• Beautifully tiled bathrooms, premium fixtures — finishes that last\r\n\r\nPerfectly Placed\r\nWalk to Smales Farm, shops, Pak'n Save, and motorway access. Minutes to Takapuna and Wairau Park. Great schools downstairs, spectacular views upstairs — this is the complete Westlake package.\r\nCrafted with care, designed with vision, and positioned perfectly. Enquire today — this one is special.",
